{"id":"e781e7ea72930406","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-abelian-algebra.md","title":"Abelian Algebra","display":"df-abelian-algebra — Abelian Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-abelian-algebra","aliases":["93-df-abelian-algebra"],"display":"df-abelian-algebra — Abelian Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-abelian]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-abelian-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-abelian-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abelian-algebra — Abelian Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e2be868cf664b716\" href=\"?note=e2be868cf664b716\" title=\"93-df-abelian\">93-df-abelian</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbAlg}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\)</span> is the type-recovering class defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e2be868cf664b716\" href=\"?note=e2be868cf664b716\" title=\"93-df-abelian\">93-df-abelian</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianAlg}_{93}\\)</span> is the expanded local predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\\mathrm{AbelianAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\\mathrm{AbelianAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an exact alias of the source class and does not introduce a second notion of abelianness or a hidden signature parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-abelian","status":"resolved","id":"e2be868cf664b716","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-abelian]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-abelian","status":"resolved","id":"e2be868cf664b716","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbAlg}$ is the type-recovering class defined in [[93-df-abelian]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbAlg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\\mathrm{AbelianAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{AbAlg}","display":true}],"bytes":727,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e2be868cf664b716"]}